<h2 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-black uppercase tracking-tighter">What Is a Form 278-T?</h2>
<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">A Form 278-T is a mandatory Periodic Transaction Report required under the Ethics in Government Act. It ensures transparency by requiring senior executive branch officials to file within 30 days of being notified of a qualifying trade, and no later than 45 days after the transaction takes place.</p>
